{100}{}{Aradesh}
{200}{}{You see Aradesh.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Radscorpions quest ongoing}
{1020}{}{Radscorpions nest done}
{2000}{}{Oh my yes. Great packs of Rad Scorpions are killing our herds. We don't know where they're from, and no matter how many we kill, there's always more!}
{2010}{}{Go on.}
{3000}{}{And now the monsters are attacking my people! Razlo is trying to find a cure for their poison, but I'm not sure how it goes.}
{3010}{}{Well, I'll help you get rid of these things!}
{3020}{}{I can help you for a price.}
{3030}{}{That's terrible. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{4000}{}{Ummm, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes! Please talk to Razlo. He possesses far more information on these creatures than I.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{As Dharma said, 'Those who tend their own flock, know the shepherd.'}
{5010}{}{I know it's hard for you to trust, but I would like to help.}
{6000}{}{Please hurry and rid us of those Rad Scorpions!}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Things are much more settled now. Razlo has been working on a cure for Rad Scorpion poison, and with that, we should be able to fight what's left of them.}
{7010}{}{You don't need to worry anymore. I destroyed the Nest.}
{8000}{}{You are truly a hero! Know that the people of Shady Sands are most grateful.}
{8010}{}{Thanks. Bye!}

